<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span> Evaluation of abstractions on diverse collection of 37 domains. We sampled 10 abstractions by prompting <span id="A4.T7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">o4-mini</span>, and measure test set accuracy while prompting <span id="A4.T7.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GPT-4o-mini</span> with each abstraction. We report both the average performance of the 10 abstractions and the best abstraction. <span id="A4.T7.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">We find that the average and best abstractions outperform standard prompting by 18.0% and 30.0% on average, respectively.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
